zy\" width=\"123\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Blank Person.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Person.jpg\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/123?cb=20150810222433\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><b><span class=\"new\" title=\"Shuu Otomo (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU2h1dV9PdG9tbz9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Shuu Otomo</span></b><br /><small>(2092-)</small>\n</td>\n<td>January 20, 2141\n</td>\n<td>January 20, 2149\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Union_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Union Party (United States)\">Union Party</a>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"new\" title=\"Yuri Popov (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvWXVyaV9Qb3Bvdj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Yuri Popov</span>\n</td>\n<td><small>notes </small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"background:#062A78;;\"><span style=\"color:white\">2</span>\n</th>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/40/Blank_Woman.png/revision/latest?cb=20151107015223\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blank Woman\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"123\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Blank Woman.png\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Woman.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/40/Blank_Woman.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/123?cb=20151107015223\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><b><span class=\"new\" title=\"Han Jin Wei (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSGFuX0ppbl9XZWk/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Han Jin Wei</span></b><br /><small>(2071–2155)</small>\n</td>\n<td>January 20, 2149\n</td>\n<td>February 16, 2155\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Union_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Union Party (United States)\">Union Party</a>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"new\" title=\"Dzu Khanh Pham (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRHp1X0toYW5oX1BoYW0/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Dzu Khanh Pham</span>\n</td>\n<td><small>Died in office. </small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"background:#062A78;;\"><span style=\"color:white\">3</span>\n</th>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150810222433\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blank Person\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"123\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Blank Person.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Person.jpg\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/123?cb=20150810222433\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><b><span class=\"new\" title=\"Dzu Khanh Pham (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRHp1X0toYW5oX1BoYW0/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Dzu Khanh Pham</span></b><br /><small>(2102–)</small>\n</td>\n<td>February 16, 2155\n</td>\n<td>January 20, 2157\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Union_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Union Party (United States)\">Union Party</a>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"new\" title=\"Dzuy Nguyen (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRHp1eV9OZ3V5ZW4/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Dzuy Nguyen</span>\n</td>\n<td><small>Succeeded to Presidency from Vice Presidency </small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"background:#FFA500;;\"><span style=\"color:white\">4</span>\n</th>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150810222433\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blank Person\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"123\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Blank Person.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Person.jpg\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/123?cb=20150810222433\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><b><span class=\"new\" title=\"Raku-Li Kim (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUmFrdS1MaV9LaW0/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Rak-Yi Kim</span></b><br /><small>(2108–)</small>\n</td>\n<td>January 20, 2157\n</td>\n<td>Present\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Conservative_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Conservative Party (United States)\">Conservative Party</a>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"new\" title=\"Lin Miyanagi (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTGluX01peWFuYWdpP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Lin Miyanagi</span>\n</td>\n<td><small>notes </small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Administrative_divisions\"><b>Administrative divisions</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAssociation_of_East-Asia%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D11&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The Association of East-Asia is divided into 60 provinces, and one capital district, each overseen by an elected governor, legislature and provincial court system. Each province is further divided into prefectures, municipalities and villages. The provinces enjoy a degree of autonomy comparable to American states or the provincial system adopted near the end of the United Federation of China.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/67/East_Asian_Association.png/revision/latest?cb=20170916040746\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"East-Asian provinces.\"><img alt=\"East-Asian provinces.\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"350\" height=\"479\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"East Asian Association.png\" data-image-key=\"East_Asian_Association.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/67/East_Asian_Association.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20170916040746\" /></a><figcaption>East-Asian provinces.</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119081229\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.057 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.076 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 714/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 8286/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 971/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 4/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 35/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   21.711      1 -total\n 65.45%   14.210      1 Template:Infobox_country\n 12.75%    2.768      3 Template:Union_Party_(United_States)/meta/color\n  7.90%    1.715      1 Template:Yesno\n  6.98%    1.516      5 Template:Color\n  5.81%    1.262      1 Template:Independent